        "jsCode": "// ALERT THROTTLING: one email per problem per hour, not one per failure.\n\nconst err = $('Classify Error').first().json;\n\nconst WINDOW_MINUTES = 60;\n\nconst num = v => Number(String(v ?? '').replace(/,/g, ''));\n \nconst alertedRecently = $input.all().some(r =>\n\n  r.json.Fingerprint === err.fingerprint &&\n\n  r.json.Alerted === 'yes' &&\n\n  err.epochMinute - num(r.json['Epoch Minute']) < WINDOW_MINUTES);\n \n// Critical errors email now (unless throttled); warnings wait for the daily digest.\n\nlet alerted = 'digest only';\n\nif (err.severity === 'critical') alerted = alertedRecently ? 'throttled' : 'yes';\n \nreturn [{ json: { ...err, alerted, sendNow: alerted === 'yes' } }];\n "
      },
